# ==============================================================================
# YASH.INST — ADMITAI PRIYA MASTER SYSTEM INSTRUCTIONS & COMPONENT PROMPTS
# ==============================================================================
# This file contains the complete, unedited, verbatim system instructions, prompts,
# dialect rules, stage directives, objection battlecards, and schema instructions
# used by all LLMs across the entire AdmitAI Priya CRM & Voice Agent codebase.
